      "id": "claim_e36f135c8ea94b7f89b2bf1d1d294539",
      "statement": "Splitter splits documents by sliding pairs of adjacent pages (page_per_split=2) and aggregates per-pair DocGroups2 verdicts into final DocGroup objects: belongs_to_same_document=True extends the current group's page list, otherwise a new group with the pair's page2 classification starts.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://extract_thinker/splitter.py",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:3aadeff5bb3bf8fdbc8e1de994bc5706fd90163a086c428614a9b8bef4d6fe2b"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_865643e2c1da48fe806069918b861dc0",
      "statement": "ImageSplitter constructs its own internal LLM from the model string at construction, so splitter and Extractor can run different models; lazy splitting compares consecutive page images pairwise while eager splitting sends all page images in a single request requesting a DocGroupsEager with groupOfDocuments {classification, pages}.",
